WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:13.040
If you know schools that could use Fixer Nation Education, you can earn a commission by sending them our way. This video shows how to apply, and what your affiliate dashboard looks like once you're approved.

2
00:00:13.541 --> 00:00:29.871
The page explains how it works. You apply, a real person here reads your application, and if it's a fit, we agree on a commission rate and a territory, and send you your own referral link. Any purchase made through your link in the next ninety days is credited to you.

3
00:00:30.371 --> 00:00:36.451
To apply, enter your name, your email, and your company or organization if you have one.

4
00:00:36.952 --> 00:00:46.952
If you have a territory in mind, choose a state and county. It's optional. Then tell us about the fit: where you sell, who you know, and what you've sold before.

5
00:00:47.452 --> 00:00:53.552
Select Submit application. We read every one, and you'll hear back by email either way.

6
00:00:54.054 --> 00:01:00.764
When your application is approved, you get an email. Open it, and select the link to choose your password.

7
00:01:01.266 --> 00:01:08.416
Type a password with at least eight characters, type it again, and save it. You'll be taken to your dashboard.

8
00:01:08.917 --> 00:01:18.747
At the top is your own referral link, with your code. Select Copy link, and share it with the schools you work with. Anyone who buys through it is credited to you.

9
00:01:19.249 --> 00:01:30.069
Below that, Commission earned has three numbers. Pending is money that isn't confirmed yet. Owed is confirmed and waiting to be paid out. And Paid is what's already been sent to you.

10
00:01:30.571 --> 00:01:44.781
Your account shows your commission rate and your territory. If you'd like a territory, or a different one, you can request it right on this page, and our team reviews it. Your commission history lists every sale, and what it paid.
